 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "The tree uses the LeetCode N-ary level-order list: the root value, null, then the children of each node in breadth-first order with every child group closed by null, trailing nulls removed; [] is the empty tree. Merge the two trees position by position, children aligned by index: where both trees have a node the merged node's value is the sum; where only one has a node the merged tree holds a copy of that subtree. Return the merged tree in the same format (inputs are not modified).",
